{"4286050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Redast", "steam_appid": 4286050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REDAST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ffb17b014bfcc3ce1b716c44ea0d04fe.poster.avif?t=1787135369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ffb17b014bfcc3ce1b716c44ea0d04fe.webm?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ffb17b014bfcc3ce1b716c44ea0d04fe.mp4?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Redast</strong> is an adrenaline-fueled survival experience that blends the horror and detective genres with co-op dynamics. Prepare to solve terrifying cases across the globe with your friends—from the prestigious museums of <strong>Europe</strong> to the mystical temples of the <strong>Far East</strong>, and from the ancient lands of the <strong>Middle East</strong> to the freezing silence of the <strong>Arctic</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/3916794853ef0322821d1544e04e6dae.poster.avif?t=1787135369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/3916794853ef0322821d1544e04e6dae.webm?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/3916794853ef0322821d1544e04e6dae.mp4?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Test Your Wit and Courage</strong> In the universe of Redast, <strong>50 different supernatural entities</strong>, each with its own unique intelligence and behavior patterns, await you. Your adversary is not just an enemy; it is a hunter that tests you, monitors your movements, and forces you to adapt your strategy at every turn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ce04fc50da308a89857470a8e9576ad9.poster.avif?t=1787135369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ce04fc50da308a89857470a8e9576ad9.webm?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ce04fc50da308a89857470a8e9576ad9.mp4?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Observe, Predict, Collect, and Exterminate</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analysis:</strong> Identify the type of entity by observing the unique behaviors it exhibits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy:</strong> Trust no one—not even your friends—but never stay alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extermination:</strong> Vanquish the darkness by gathering the necessary items and performing the unique combinations specifically designed for each entity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/5d95a59adb58461c1dad7ceaf1ef7b53.poster.avif?t=1787135369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/5d95a59adb58461c1dad7ceaf1ef7b53.webm?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/5d95a59adb58461c1dad7ceaf1ef7b53.mp4?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far more than an ordinary horror game, <strong>Redast</strong> invites you on a true detective adventure with a dynamic structure that changes with every mission. <strong>Gather your team, observe, piece together the evidence, and survive!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REDAST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ffb17b014bfcc3ce1b716c44ea0d04fe.poster.avif?t=1787135369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ffb17b014bfcc3ce1b716c44ea0d04fe.webm?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/ffb17b014bfcc3ce1b716c44ea0d04fe.mp4?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Redast</strong> is an adrenaline-fueled survival experience that blends the horror and detective genres with co-op dynamics. Prepare to solve terrifying cases across the globe with your friends—from the prestigious museums of <strong>Europe</strong> to the mystical temples of the <strong>Far East</strong>, and from the ancient lands of the <strong>Middle East</strong> to the freezing silence of the <strong>Arctic</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/3916794853ef0322821d1544e04e6dae.poster.avif?t=1787135369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286050/extras/3916794853ef0322821d1544e04e6dae.webm?t=1787135369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta